flowchart LR
  I[Instruction request / address] --> ARB[Arbiter: instruction first, pending data next]
  D[Data request / address / write payload] --> P[Pending request registers]
  D --> ARB
  P --> ARB
  ARB --> MUX[Address mux]
  MUX --> MEM[One 32 x 32 array: ONE read port]
  D -->|write payload| MEM
  P -->|retained payload| MEM
  MEM --> RESP[Registered instruction / data responses]
  ARB --> RESP
  RESP --> DONE[Done pulses: requester turnaround cycle]
